@startsalt pickup-car-allocation
{+
    <b>CAR RENTAL | Agency employee
    --
    <b>Pick up car - Allocate a car
    RES-001 - Alex Martin - Compact
    .
    {^"Available cars - Toulouse agency"
        {#
            <b>Select | <b>Brand / model | <b>Colour | <b>Licence plate | <b>Category
            (X) | Renault Clio | Blue | AB-123-CD | Compact
            () | Peugeot 208 | White | EF-456-GH | Compact
        }
        [Refresh availability]
    }
    .
    {^"Selected car"
        Renault Clio | Blue | AB-123-CD
        Allocate this car to reservation RES-001.
    }
    .
    If no car is available, refresh or return to the reservation.
    Continue only after the allocation is confirmed.
    --
    [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-reservation-details Back]] ] | [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-driving-licence Allocate and continue]] ]
}
@endsalt
